  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the oven to 220C, fan-forced. Line a large oven tray with baking paper. Thinly slice the tomato. Halve the olives. Peel the zucchini into ribbons with a vegetable peeler. Pick the mint leaves, discarding the stems. Drain 1 tbs oil from the marinated goat cheese into a bowl. Add 2 tsp honey, season with salt and pepper and whisk to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4220508/photos/large/104788_1-4da12496ef2ac194b6622700e9b1397d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Soften zucchini: Pour 1 tbs oil from the marinated goat cheese into a medium frypan over high heat (see Make it faster). Cook the zucchini, stirring, for 1-2 mins until just tender. Remove the pan from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4220509/photos/large/104788_2-0e66258407248fc4b69ebd1c3dcfce60.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Assemble pizzas: Put 2 pita on the lined tray. Spread with tomato paste and top with the tomato and zucchini. Scatter over the olives.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4220510/photos/large/104788_3-baffa274f1dc102110e60f4f80810adc.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake pizzas: Bake the pizzas for 10-12 mins until golden.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4220511/photos/large/104788_4-630c4c6edf06ef8e74a890abc91f0b27.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Crumble the goat cheese over the pizzas and drizzle with the honey dressing. Scatter over the mint leaves, cut into wedges and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4220512/photos/large/104788_5-2bfcc6a1a6173ff923813f520a348efc.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it faster: Short on time? Skip this step and simply put the raw zucchini ribbons on the pizza bases. The zucchini will just be a bit crispier once baked.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4220513/photos/large/104788_6-2dde9ce4df5ae41c9273f45adff0446b.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
